2. ONNX Runtime
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
ONNX Runtime 1.25.0, Microsoft, лицензия MIT.
https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime

Бинарники ONNX Runtime (onnxruntime.dll / libonnxruntime.so / .dylib и провайдер
